ipt Validation** | `npx tsc --noEmit` | 0 errors |\n| **Next.js Production Build** | `npm run build` | Generated static pages & optimized bundles |\n| **Python Backend & ML Syntax** | `python -m py_compile ...` | All files syntax-valid |\n","Description":"Create Phase 1 initialization walkthrough artifact","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\chauh\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Creating walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Create walkthrough.md"}}]}
