{"step_index":146,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:08:00Z","content":"# AUTOMIND AI — Phase 1 Initialization Complete\n\nThe foundational architecture for **AUTOMIND AI** has been established at:\n`C:\\Users\\chauh\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\automind-ai`\n\n*(Recommendation: Set `automind-ai` as your active workspace folder in your IDE).*\n\n---\n\n### What Was Created\n\n#### 1. Architecture Blueprint & Monorepo Structure\n* **[README.md](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/README.md)**: End-to-end system architecture specification, REST API contracts, data flows, security boundaries, and local startup workflows.\n* **[package.json](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/package.json)** & **[.gitignore](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/.gitignore)**: Root workspace commands and repository hygiene rules.\n\n#### 2. Frontend Layer (`frontend/`)\n* **Framework**: Next.js (App Router), React 18, TypeScript (Strict), Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, Three.js, React Three Fiber (`@react-three/fiber`, `@react-three/drei`), Lucide React.\n* **Base Design System (Luxury Dark Automotive Theme)**:\n  * **[globals.css](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/globals.css)** & **[tailwind.config.ts](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/tailwind.config.ts)**: Obsidian backgrounds (`#07090E`), cyber cyan glow (`#00F0FF`), crimson accents (`#FF2A54`), custom glassmorphism (`backdrop-blur-md`), and carbon grid lines.\n  * **Reusable Atomic Components**:\n    * [`Button`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/button.tsx) (variants: `primary`, `secondary`, `crimson`, `outline`, `ghost`, `glass` with loading states)\n    * [`Card`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/card.tsx) (glassmorphism panels with optional neon glow)\n    * [`Badge`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/badge.tsx) (high-contrast automotive status indicators)\n    * [`Input`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/input.tsx) (icon support, glow rings)\n    * [`Container`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/container.tsx) (responsive layout wrapper)\n* **Type System & API Client**:\n  * Strict DTO interfaces: [`types/car.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/types/car.ts), [`types/ml.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/types/ml.ts), [`types/ai.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/types/ai.ts).\n  * Typed REST client: [`lib/api/client.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/lib/api/client.ts) (proxies all AI/ML calls to FastAPI, zero browser key leakage).\n  * Formatting helpers: [`lib/utils.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/lib/utils.ts) (currency, mileage, HP, 0-60s timing).\n* **Entry Layout & Landing Shell**:\n  * [`app/layout.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/layout.tsx) & [`app/page.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/page.tsx) demonstrating design system health and modular status.\n\n#### 3. Backend Layer (`backend/`)\n* **Framework**: FastAPI, Python 3.12, Uvicorn, Pydantic v2, Pydantic Settings, `google-genai` SDK, Supabase / PostgreSQL.\n* **Encapsulated Security**:\n  * [`app/core/config.py`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/backend/app/core/config.py): Typed environment settings.\n  * [`app/db/session.py`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/backend/app/db/session.py): Supabase